            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl wartości od <code>4</code> do <code>8</code> w konsoli, umieszczając instrukcję wyświetlania po <code>counter += 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+=1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>print</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, a potem <code>counter</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
